     *   SCLL  = 68   -> t_SCLL  = (68 + 1) * 23.529 ns = 1623.5 ns
     *   SCLH  = 35   -> t_SCLH  = (35 + 1) * 23.529 ns = 847.1 ns
     *   SDADEL = 2   -> t_SDADEL = 2 * 23.529 ns = 47.1 ns
     *   SCLDEL = 4   -> t_SCLDEL = (4 + 1) * 23.529 ns = 117.6 ns (>= 100 ns)
     *
     * Bus timing checks:
     *   t_SYNC1 = t_SYNC2 = 2 * t_I2CCLK ≈ 11.76 ns
     *   t_LOW  = t_SCLL + t_SYNC1 = 1623.5 + 11.8 = 1635.3 ns >= 1300 ns (Fm min)
