  * VCO frequency: $f_{VCO} = f_{VCO\_IN} \times N = 4\text{ MHz} \times 85 = 340\text{ MHz}$ ($N = 85$, bits `PLLN = 85`).
  * PLL "R" Output: $f_{PLL\_R} = \frac{f_{VCO}}{R} = \frac{340\text{ MHz}}{2} = 170\text{ MHz}$ ($R = 2$, bits `PLLR = 00b`).
