2. **Flash Wait States**: At 170 MHz in Range 1 Boost Mode ($V_{DD} > 2.7\text{ V}$), the Flash memory controller requires 4 wait states (`FLASH_ACR_LATENCY_4WS`).
3. **HSE & PLL Setup**:
   - $\text{VCO}_{\text{IN}} = \frac{f_{\text{HSE}}}{\text{PLLM}} = \frac{8\text{ MHz}}{2} = 4\text{ MHz}$
   - $f_{\text{VCO}} = \text{VCO}_{\text{IN}} \times \text{PLLN} = 4\text{ MHz} \times 85 = 340\text{ MHz}$
   - $f_{\text{PLL\_R}} = \frac{f_{\text{VCO}}}{\text{PLLR}} = \frac{340\text{ MHz}}{2} = 170\text{ MHz}$ (0.0% error)
4. **Prescalers & Clock Switch**: The reset values of `HPRE` (AHB), `PPRE1` (APB1), and `PPRE2` (APB2) prescalers in `RCC->CFGR` are all divide-by-1, yielding:
   $$\text{SYSCLK} = \text{HCLK} = \text{PCLK1} = \text{PCLK2} = 170\text{ MHz}$$

