     * Board pull-ups / passive leakage: **$\approx 1.0\text{ }\mu\text{A}$**
     * **Total Node Sleep Current:** $\mathbf{\approx 17.5\text{ }\mu\text{A}}$ (well under the $50\text{ }\mu\text{A}$ ceiling).

