     - Output High ($V_{\text{OH,min}}$): $\ge V_{\text{DD}} - 0.4\text{ V} = 2.9\text{ V} > V_{\text{IH,min}}$.
     - Output Low ($V_{\text{OL,max}}$): $\le 0.4\text{ V} < V_{\text{IL,max}}$.
