   - **Flash Latency**: At $V_{\text{CORE}}$ Range 1 Normal Mode and $150\text{ MHz}$, the Flash access requires 4 wait states (`LATENCY = 4WS`) [RM0440 p.149].
   - **PLL Settings**:
