     - $V_{IL} \le 0.3 \times V_{DD} = 0.99\text{ V}$
   - **Output Levels**:
     - Both chips guarantee $V_{OH} \ge V_{DD} - 0.4\text{ V} = 2.90\text{ V}$ and $V_{OL} \le 0.40\text{ V}$.
