     *    ARR = 42499 (period = (ARR + 1) / 21.25 MHz = 42500 / 21.25 MHz = 2 ms -> 500 Hz)
     *    CCR1 = 12750 (duty cycle = CCR1 / (ARR + 1) = 12750 / 42500 = 30.0%)
