$$t_{\text{SCL}} = t_{\text{SYNC1}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}} + \left[(SCLH + 1) + (SCLL + 1)\right] \times (PRESC + 1) \times t_{\text{I2CCLK}}$$

Choosing standard prescaling:
- `PRESC = 3` (prescaler division factor = $PRESC + 1 = 4$), giving a prescaled clock period $t_{\text{PRESC}} = 4 \times 62.5\text{ ns} = 250\text{ ns}$.
