  - $t_{\text{HIGH}} = t_{\text{SCLH}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}} = 4.0\ \mu\text{s} + 0.125\ \mu\text{s} = 4.125\ \mu\text{s} \ge 4.0\ \mu\text{s}$ (Compliant).
