    /* 2. Configure Flash memory access latency
     * For HCLK = 80 MHz in VCORE Range 1 normal mode, 2 wait states (LATENCY = 2)
     * are required (≤ 90 MHz requires 2 WS) [STM32G474_RM0440 p.98].
     * Increasing CPU frequency requires setting LATENCY before raising frequency [STM32G474_RM0440 p.152].
