     $$f_{\text{PLL\_R}} = \frac{160\text{ MHz}}{2} = 80.0\text{ MHz}$$
   - Enabling `PLLREN` (bit 24 of `RCC_PLLCFGR`) enables the PLLCLK signal to feed the SYSCLK multiplexer [STM32G474_RM0440 p.292].

3. **Bus Prescalers**:
