- **Clock**: HSI16 at 16 MHz ($f_{\text{CK}} = 16\text{ MHz}$).
- **Baud Rate**: $9600\text{ baud}$ with oversampling by 16 (`OVER8 = 0`).
  $$\text{USARTDIV} = \frac{16\,000\,000}{9600} \approx 1666.667 \implies \text{BRR} = 1667 \ (0\text{x}0683)$$
  $$\text{Actual Baud Rate} = \frac{16\,000\,000}{1667} \approx 9598.08\text{ baud} \quad (-0.02\%\text{ error})$$
- **Pins**:
  - `PA2`: `USART2_TX` (AF7, AFRL bitfield `AFSEL2 = 7`) [STM32G474_Datasheet p.73] [STM32G474_RM0440 p.359]
  - `PA15`: `USART2_RX` (AF7, AFRH bitfield `AFSEL15 = 7`, floating / no pull-up or pull-down) [STM32G474_Datasheet p.73] [STM32G474_RM0440 p.360]

