     * USART1 Peripheral Configuration:
     * - Bus: APB2 (fCK = 170 MHz)
     * - 921600 baud, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit, oversampling by 16
     * - BRR = 170,000,000 / 921,600 = 184 (0x00B8) -> 923,913 baud (+0.25% error)
